FILE: vUX-timeLineList.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
The resize handler was an anonymous closure passed straight to addEventListener, so it
could never be removed, and the marker classes activateList() applied were permanent.
The handler is now the named wrapList function (it takes no arguments, so the event
object it is handed is harmless), and every activated list is recorded so destroy() can
strip 'vtimeLine', its unique class, 'activated' and 'wrap' again.

